---
/**
 * The hero: Apple's MacBook Pro 14-inch (M5) product bezel from Apple Design
 * Resources, unmodified, with the screen content underneath it at the bezel's
 * screen size (1512 x 982 pt, 3024 x 1964 px) and scaled to fit. One story
 * plays on it (scripts/scene.ts): Claude Code finishes a fix and calls
 * needs-you ask, the island speaks the question, the beam lights up the screen
 * edges, the spoken answer goes back as the tool result; then "Hey Mac" sends a
 * message to Codex in another window. The island, the beam and the subtitles
 * copy the app's own code (Island.swift, Glow.swift, Subtitles.swift). Names
 * and code are made up. The wallpaper is our own (public/scene, light and
 * dark), and the Dock has neutral icons drawn here plus Homemade and Needs You
 * side by side.
 */
const bars26 = Array.from({ length: 26 });
const bars5 = Array.from({ length: 5 });
---
<div class="sc" data-scene>
  <div class="sc-device">
    <div class="sc-screen" role="img" aria-label="A Mac screen. Claude Code fixes a rounding bug and asks “Tests pass. Ship it to staging?” out loud through Needs You. The answer “Yes, ship it.” goes back to it. Then “Hey Mac, docs site: …” types a message into Codex in another window.">
      <div class="sc-inner" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="sc-menubar">
          <span class="sc-mb-left">
            <svg class="sc-apple" viewBox="0 0 14 17" width="14" height="17" fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.6 9c0-2 1.7-3 1.7-3.1-1-1.4-2.4-1.6-2.9-1.6-1.2-.1-2.4.7-3 .7-.6 0-1.6-.7-2.6-.7C3.4 4.3 2 5.1 1.3 6.4-.2 9-.1 13 2.4 15.5c.6.9 1.4 1.8 2.3 1.8.9 0 1.3-.6 2.4-.6s1.4.6 2.4.6c1 0 1.6-.9 2.2-1.8.7-1 1-2 1-2.1 0 0-2.1-.8-2.1-3.4zM9.7 3.2c.5-.7.9-1.6.8-2.5-.8 0-1.7.5-2.3 1.2-.5.6-.9 1.5-.8 2.4.9.1 1.7-.4 2.3-1.1z"/></svg>
            <b>Ghostty</b><span>File</span><span>Edit</span><span>View</span><span>Window</span><span>Help</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sc-mb-right">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 18 14" width="17" height="13" fill="currentColor"><rect x="0" y="5" width="2" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="4" y="2" width="2" height="10" rx="1"/><rect x="8" y="0" width="2" height="14" rx="1"/><rect x="12" y="3" width="2" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="16" y="5.5" width="2" height="3" rx="1"/></svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 26 13" width="25" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><rect x=".5" y=".5" width="22" height="12" rx="3.5" opacity=".5"/><rect x="2.5" y="2.5" width="15" height="8" rx="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M24.5 4.5v4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".5"/></svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 12" width="16" height="12" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 2.2c2.2 0 4.2.8 5.7 2.2l1.1-1.2C13 1.5 10.6.5 8 .5S3 1.5 1.2 3.2l1.1 1.2C3.8 3 5.8 2.2 8 2.2zm0 3.4c1.3 0 2.5.5 3.4 1.3l1.1-1.2C11.3 4.6 9.7 4 8 4s-3.3.6-4.5 1.7l1.1 1.2c.9-.8 2.1-1.3 3.4-1.3zm0 3.4c.5 0 .9.2 1.2.5L8 11 6.8 9.5c.3-.3.7-.5 1.2-.5z"/></svg>
            <span>Thu 26 Nov</span><span>9:41</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <section class="sc-win sc-claude" data-win="claude">
          <header class="sc-titlebar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>claude · ~/code/invoice-api</span></header>
          <pre class="sc-term"><span class="d">&gt; Some invoices are a cent off. Fix the rounding, run the tests,
  and ask me before you ship it.</span>

<span class="w">●</span> Tax is rounded after it is added to the subtotal, so half-cents
  go the wrong way on some orders.

<span class="g">●</span> <b>Update</b>(src/billing/totals.ts)
  <span class="d">⎿  Updated src/billing/totals.ts with 2 additions and 1 removal</span>
      <span class="d">29</span>    const subtotal = sumLines(lines);
<span class="rm">      30 -  return Math.round(subtotal * (1 + taxRate) * 100) / 100; </span>
<span class="add">      30 +  const tax = roundHalfEven(subtotal * taxRate, 2); </span>
<span class="add">      31 +  return toCents(subtotal) + tax; </span>

<span class="g">●</span> <b>Bash</b>(npm test)
  <span class="d">⎿  Test Files  18 passed (18)
          Tests  246 passed (246)</span>
<span data-step="ask" hidden>
<span class="g" data-dot="ask">●</span> <b>needs-you - ask (MCP)</b>(question: "Tests pass. Ship it to staging?")
  <span class="d" data-show="waiting">⎿  Waiting for your answer…</span><span data-show="answered" hidden>  <span class="d">⎿</span>  {"{"}"status":"answered","transcript":"Yes, ship it."{"}"}</span>
</span><span data-step="deploy" hidden>
<span class="g">●</span> <b>Bash</b>(npm run deploy:staging)
  <span class="d" data-show="deploying">⎿  Running…</span><span class="d" data-show="deployed" hidden>⎿  Deployed invoice-api@2.4.1 to staging in 41s</span>
</span><span data-step="shipped" hidden>
<span class="w">●</span> Shipped to staging. The rounding fix is in 2.4.1.
</span>
<span class="sp" data-show="spinner">✻ Thinking… <span class="d">(esc to interrupt)</span></span>
<span class="box">╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ &gt;                                                                │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span>
  <span class="d">? for shortcuts</span></pre>
        </section>

        <section class="sc-win sc-codex" data-win="codex">
          <header class="sc-titlebar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>codex · ~/code/docs-site</span></header>
          <pre class="sc-term"><span class="d">╭───────────────────────────────────────╮</span>
<span class="d">│</span> <b>&gt;_ OpenAI Codex</b>                       <span class="d">│</span>
<span class="d">│</span>                                       <span class="d">│</span>
<span class="d">│</span> <span class="d">directory: ~/code/docs-site</span>           <span class="d">│</span>
<span class="d">╰───────────────────────────────────────╯</span>

<span class="d">›</span> Add a page for the 2.4 release notes

<span class="d">•</span> Added docs/releases/2.4.md and linked it
  from the sidebar.
<span data-step="typed" hidden>
<span class="d">›</span> <span class="u">add the rounding fix to the 2.4 release notes
  (sent by voice: reply by voice with needs-you)</span>

<span class="cx">•</span> <span class="d">Working (1s • esc to interrupt)</span>
</span>
<span class="d">› </span><span class="ph" data-show="placeholder">Ask Codex to do anything</span></pre>
        </section>

        <div class="sc-dock">
          <span class="sc-dock-item" data-name="Finder">
            <img src="/scene/dock/finder.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
            <i class="sc-dock-run"></i>
          </span>
          <span class="sc-dock-item" data-name="Safari">
            <img src="/scene/dock/safari.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
          </span>
          <span class="sc-dock-item" data-name="System Settings">
            <img src="/scene/dock/settings.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
          </span>
          <span class="sc-dock-item" data-name="Ghostty">
            <img src="/scene/dock/ghostty.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
            <i class="sc-dock-run"></i>
          </span>
          <a class="sc-dock-item" data-name="Homemade" href="https://homemade.dev/home" aria-label="Homemade">
            <img src="/brand/homemade-on-dark.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48" class="sc-dock-hm" />
          </a>
          <span class="sc-dock-item" data-name="Needs You">
            <img src="/icons/icon-128.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
            <i class="sc-dock-run"></i>
          </span>
          <span class="sc-dock-sep"></span>
          <span class="sc-dock-item" data-name="Trash">
            <img src="/scene/dock/trash.webp" alt="" width="48" height="48" />
          </span>
        </div>

        <canvas class="sc-beam" width="756" height="491"></canvas>

        <div class="sc-subs"><p data-subs></p></div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 734px)" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" />
      <img class="sc-frame" src="/device/macbook-pro-14-space-black-1x.webp" srcset="/device/macbook-pro-14-space-black-1x.webp 1930w, /device/macbook-pro-14-space-black-2x.webp 3860w" sizes="(min-width: 1180px) 1140px, 100vw" width="3860" height="2540" alt="" />
    </picture>
    <div class="sc-top" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="sc-inner sc-top-inner">
        <div class="sc-island" data-mode="idle">
          <svg class="sc-isl-shape" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#000" /></svg>
          <div class="sc-isl-glow"></div>
          <div class="sc-isl-content">
            <div class="sc-layer" data-layer="wake">
              <div class="sc-ears"><span class="sc-orb sc-ripple"></span><span class="sc-bars sc-bars-wake">{bars5.map(() => <i />)}</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-layer" data-layer="listening">
              <div class="sc-ears"><span class="sc-orb"></span><span class="sc-timer" data-timer>0:00</span></div>
              <div class="sc-body">
                <div class="sc-label"><b>Listening</b><small>Say “done” when you’re finished</small></div>
                <span class="sc-bars">{bars26.map(() => <i />)}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-layer" data-layer="thinking">
              <div class="sc-ears"><span class="sc-dots"><i /><i /><i /></span><span class="sc-shimmer">Thinking</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-layer" data-layer="sending">
              <div class="sc-ears"><span class="sc-orb"></span><span class="sc-right"><span class="sc-note" data-target>docs-site</span><svg class="sc-ring" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7" class="t" /><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7" class="p" data-ring /></svg></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-layer" data-layer="done">
              <div class="sc-ears"><span class="sc-orb"></span><svg class="sc-check" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M3.5 9.5 7.1 12.9 14.5 5" /></svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-layer" data-layer="speaking">
              <div class="sc-ears"><span class="sc-orb warm"></span><span class="sc-chat">invoice-api</span></div>
              <div class="sc-body">
                <div class="sc-label"><b>Claude</b><small data-spoken>Tests pass. Ship it to staging?</small></div>
                <span class="sc-bars warm">{bars26.map(() => <i />)}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
